            <h1 class="text-[42px] md:text-[68px] font-bold text-ink mb-[26px]">About Us</h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-slate leading-8 mb-6">Established in the year 2014, CCAI Pipe Industries has created a name for itself as a prominent and well reputed Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of RCC concrete pipes in Kathmandu, Nepal. We believe in strong business ethics as far as our clients are concerned, which has made it possible for us to attain trust and support from our esteemed Customers.</p>

            <p class="text-lg text-slate leading-8 mb-6">Contech Concrete and Allied Industry is a joint venture of Contech Pvt Ltd, a reputed large scale A-Class Construction and Equipment Rental Company in Nepal, and the group of pioneer RCC pipe manufacturers.</p>

            <p class="text-lg text-slate leading-8 mb-[42px]">Our manufacturing plant is based in Satungal, Kathmandu on almost a hectare of land with very sound infrastructure.</p>

            <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.05em] uppercase text-primary mb-[10px]">Our Purpose</p>
            <h2 class="text-[42px] font-bold text-ink mb-[26px]">Mission &amp; Vision</h2>
