                <h3 class="text-[26px] font-bold text-ink mb-2">Mission</h3>
                <p class="text-slate leading-7">Our mission is to manufacture top quality RCC concrete pipes using the latest technology available in the world to cater to the needs of Nepal.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-[26px] border-l-4 border-accent border border-line">
                <h3 class="text-[26px] font-bold text-ink mb-2">Vision</h3>
                <p class="text-slate leading-7">Our vision is to become the biggest manufacturer of RCC concrete pipes within Nepal without compromising the quality of our product.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

